// COACH_API_KEY is an OpenRouter key (https://openrouter.ai/keys). project.yml
// injects it into Info.plist at build time, which means it ships inside the app
// binary and is extractable from the .ipa. It is fine for local development and
// must NOT survive into an App Store build — the coach moves behind the Supabase
// edge function (supabase/functions/coach) before release, and this key is deleted.

